      "comment": "WHISKEY SERVICE (7) has a strong overall record having 16 wins and 27 places from 65 starts including a last start success (29.88) over 520m at this track. Has a strong record here at this journey including four wins. Drawn wide but with a clean break will be tough to beat again. SLEEK KARMA (1) turned in a plain effort last time when sixth at Q Lakeside over 352m behind Zippity Zeal (20.37) in a Mix 5. Can do much better this time. RECONSTRUCTION (8) is a talented type and proved too strong last time to win by 6 lengths at this track in a handy 29.88 beating Cha Cha Kitty. Makes plenty of appeal if runs up to latest. MARGARET'S ANGEL (2) can measure up with the right run.",
